{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現年44歲的「旅遊達人」梁芷珮（Christy）向來保養得宜，雖然已是三個孩子的母親，但憑藉一直保持良好的運動與飲食習慣，身形依然維持得極好，完全沒有走樣。近日，她在社交平台發布了一段短片，親身示範夏日度假的服飾配搭。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9902466d-1118-492f-8adf-10da1d03e18d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ML2VzueuKP1787906263.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9902466d-1118-492f-8adf-10da1d03e18d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5c4bea3e-79dc-411a-afec-895b310c11c6.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026xzSHm0VOX71787906263.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5c4bea3e-79dc-411a-afec-895b310c11c6.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">片中，梁芷珮以一件頭泳裝上陣，充滿自信地展現健康迷人的小麥色肌膚，絕佳狀態讓廣大網民紛紛留言，大讚她是名副其實的「火辣靚媽」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e3d98152-5627-4147-98af-831e1b96c6eb.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026TMcuTyaa8y1787906263.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e3d98152-5627-4147-98af-831e1b96c6eb.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f445f43d-69c8-4c3e-8708-84c37b0d29f5.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026OCRRVz23hl1787906263.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f445f43d-69c8-4c3e-8708-84c37b0d29f5.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了大派福利展示好身材，梁芷珮更親自教路四招極具創意的夏日度假穿搭術。她巧妙地利用一條絲巾，先後將其綁成連衣裙、短裙、斜膊上衣以及充滿度假風情的頭巾，完美示範了實用又時尚的百變造型，獲網民大讚創意十足。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T02:58:19.947661+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}